This fork of CleanTrack Uganda focuses on backend development.
New features were implemented in the backend only, tested via Postman and database migrations.
The frontend was not modified.

# Prerequisites
Node.js v18+ and npm v9+

MySQL or MariaDB (local instance)

Git (for cloning and version control)

Postman or Insomnia (for API testing)
# New Features Implemented
1. # Recurring Pickup Schedules
Endpoint: POST /api/schedules

Database: pickup_schedules table

Function: Allows customers to set daily/weekly/monthly pickups.

2. # Pickup History & Receipts
Endpoint: GET /api/pickups/history/:userId

Database: pickups table extended with completed_at and receipt_url

Function: Tracks completed pickups and provides downloadable receipts.

3. # Notifications (Email/SMS)
Endpoint: POST /api/users/notifications

Database: users table extended with notification preferences
Function: Sends alerts via email (Nodemailer) and SMS (Twilio).

